ame": "011.RS_D+_Screenshot_03.png", "id": "1062786108591961", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830890_1062786111925294_6820825958812217735_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d4wTxxNlZs8Q7kNvwEx1ZSF&_nc_oc=Adm63VTzYNyXBEAnD3WWXRpu9XgSqbbRkhEWhxz7Q7zCPTvkwkJlco5w1XRwg2hKXZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuOdJcRVNRo3Lhy6o1-Y2gwW0xXBV-HN6AXg9DhNHCiJg&oe=69A2ED2D"}, {"file_name": "012.RS_D+_Screenshot_04.png", "id": "1888807391681363", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308589_1888807395014696_660138509703032651_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jw2J6wlJbLMQ7kNvwEpZ1dd&_nc_oc=AdnXhhbuo3HteQvWcm0MUP2dtt-lFpQKUx-nSeAM5Iyk-Iy_3f0GiQGNBgQfQ7kWUmY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfssmMoTVDh2vKeCUKrFY-whmnJvf_M0kJp4caWqmJBZvA&oe=69A2FBBA"}, {"file_name": "009.RS_D+_Screenshot_01.png", "id": "4068036953513638", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292867_4068036956846971_624713770870370506_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dKz-AbwkmPcQ7kNvwF6smbg&_nc_oc=AdlXfQYNnKSmclyXHhiLI5ZIJcYEOEC_12ztcPyFYEWtw7U7YkLCEC3NGbQKtDv3XOc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftOBEpzAh-8GB6yiHR5R07kXbhlbRQigCejBwaLAOS1Lw&oe=69A2E2A1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RS-Dental+", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Important: More content is available with institutional registration.\n\nRSD+ is a VR-based simulator for dental radiographic diagnosis and practice, providing students with a realistic environment to train in radiography procedures without exposure to radiation.\n\nThrough various scenario-based simulations, learners can train in patient interaction, chart review, clinical assessment, X-ray equipment handling, film positioning, and post-exam image review.\n\n With VRAD's patented medical image processing algorithm, X-ray images are dynamically generated based